        Client.QUEST_DIALOGUE_LAYOUTS.minimal.ink.rewardLine,
        Client.QUEST_DIALOGUE_LAYOUTS.minimal.quest.rewardLineSize)
    -- With money on it, the line is its label, the coins, then this tail
